{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_17827","headline":"贺田仆射子弟荣拜金吾 · 杨巨源","name":"贺田仆射子弟荣拜金吾","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"五侯恩泽不同年，叔侄朱门䂍矟连。\n凤沼九重相喜气，鴈行一半入祥烟。\n街衢烛影侵寒月，文武珂声叠晓天。\n爲数麒麟高阁上，谁家父子勒燕然。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"杨巨源","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_17827.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_17827","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}